1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,620
Attention!

2
00:00:01,140 --> 00:00:02,620
We are now beginning a fire drill.

3
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,820
Would all staff designated as fire wardens please make your way to your positions immediately?

4
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:11,905
And all employees should now make their way out of the building.

5
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:12,880
Do not run.

6
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,680
Do not use the elevators.

7
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,560
If you are in the center of the building, you may use the escalators.

8
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:22,740
If you are close to the entrance doors, use the emergency stairs.

9
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:27,940
Please follow the instructions from the fire wardens, who will be wearing orange vests.

10
00:00:28,535 --> 00:00:29,520
Thank you for your attention.

11
00:00:30,425 --> 00:00:33,540
You may re-enter the building when the all-clear signal is given.
